                        "review": "I don't know if Aldorlea is still making games or not, but if you are.\n1 Enable an option to adjust resolution, basically I have the choice between a tiny unplayable window, or Alt + Enter to make it full screen which makes the mouse position not line up to the cursor so you don't know where you are clicking.\n2 Enable Controller Support.\nI love classic turn based RPGs and I'd love to play this and give it a proper review.\nTo anyone else reading this, it applies to every Aldorlea game that I have tried.\nI wanted to leave this without a thumbs up or thumbs down because I didn't get to play the game, but it forces me to pick one and I can't give a thumbs up for an unplayable game.\nI will change my review to a thumbs up if they get it fixed, I have tried this on both Windows and Linux, I wouldn't leave the thumbs down if it were only broken on Linux,",
